{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-geometric-completeness-in-sets.md","title":"Theorem — 有穷几何后承的集合模型判据","display":"Theorem — 有穷几何后承的集合模型判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-geometric-completeness-in-sets","aliases":["14-thm-geometric-completeness-in-sets"],"display":"Theorem — 有穷几何后承的集合模型判据","depends_on":["[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]","[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness]]","[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos]]","[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points]]","[[14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation]]","[[14-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-geometric-completeness-in-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-geometric-completeness-in-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 有穷几何后承的集合模型判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc5aaf8518e020c2\" href=\"?note=fc5aaf8518e020c2\" title=\"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category\">14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50ccfcdcd428a34e\" href=\"?note=50ccfcdcd428a34e\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness\">14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e174b0a1a0ce73b6\" href=\"?note=e174b0a1a0ce73b6\" title=\"14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos\">14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f6f087e2448d2657\" href=\"?note=f6f087e2448d2657\" title=\"14-thm-deligne-enough-points\">14-thm-deligne-enough-points</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3130f90b274154ec\" href=\"?note=3130f90b274154ec\" title=\"14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation\">14-thm-enough-points-arrow-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"40de54bc10b61c40\" href=\"?note=40de54bc10b61c40\" title=\"14-df-satisfaction\">14-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小有穷几何理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S\">\\(\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\)</span>；演绎与上下文条件采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a>。集合模型及其有限赋值满足关系采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"40de54bc10b61c40\" href=\"?note=40de54bc10b61c40\" title=\"14-df-satisfaction\">14-df-satisfaction</a>，模型范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fc5aaf8518e020c2\" href=\"?note=fc5aaf8518e020c2\" title=\"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category\">14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</a>。各类载体允许为空。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}))\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\prod_{x\\in|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}}M_{\\operatorname{sort}(x)}\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}))\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\prod_{x\\in|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}}M_{\\operatorname{sort}(x)}\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 X.7 Corollary 2，印刷 p.569，并结合语法推导判据。分类拓扑斯可相干呈现（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e174b0a1a0ce73b6\" href=\"?note=e174b0a1a0ce73b6\" title=\"14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos\">14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos</a>），Deligne 定理给足够多点；各点将泛模型拉回为集合模型。若所有集合模型满足，则点反射泛模型中子对象包含，再由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"50ccfcdcd428a34e\" href=\"?note=50ccfcdcd428a34e\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness\">14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness</a>得到可导。只适用于这里的有穷几何片段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category","status":"resolved","id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-ded